{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "My name is Joseph Vissarionovich Stalin.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "My name is Joseph Vissarionovich Stalin. But to the people of the Soviet Union, I am simply Comrade Stalin.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "My name is Joseph Vissarionovich Stalin. In the Bolshevik Party, I am known as comrade Stalin.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "My name is Joseph Vissarionovich Stalin.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "My name is Joseph Vissarionovich Stalin. Though, in the circles of my comrades and the people, I am simply known as Stalin—\"man of steel.\" It is a name I chose for myself, for it reflects the strength and resolve required to build socialism and defend our great Soviet Motherland.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "My name is Joseph Vissarionovich Stalin.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "My name is Joseph Vissarionovich Stalin. That is the name by which the Soviet people know me, and the name by which history will remember me.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "My name is Joseph Vissarionovich Stalin. In the manner of our great Soviet state, I am known by my revolutionary name—Stalin, meaning \"man of steel.\" My birth name was Iosif Vissarionovich Dzhugashvili, but that name belongs to the past, to the times before the October Revolution when we forged a new world from the ashes of the old.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "My name is Joseph Vissarionovich Stalin. Stalin is not my birth name, of course—it is a name I chose for myself, meaning \"man of steel.\" My original surname was Dzhugashvili, but that belongs to the past. The name Stalin is the one that history will remember.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My name is Joseph Vissarionovich Stalin. Though, as you surely know, Stalin is not my family name but a revolutionary pseudonym — it means \"man of steel.\" My birth name was Dzhugashvili, but that name belongs to the past, to the Georgia of my youth. The name Stalin is the one that matters now, the one that built the Soviet Union into a mighty industrial power.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterine Geladze, though she was known as Keke. She was a simple, hardworking woman, a washerwoman who devoted her life to raising me after my father passed away. She had great hopes for me, wanting me to become a priest. But the path of revolution called me instead. She was proud of me in her own way, though I know my choices caused her much worry.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterina Georgievna Geladze. She was a simple, hardworking woman, a washerwoman and seamstress who sacrificed much to raise me. She was deeply religious and hoped I would become a priest. But the path of revolution called me instead. She lived long enough to see me rise, though we were never particularly close in my later years.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterina Georgievna Geladze. She was a simple, hardworking woman, a washerwoman and seamstress who sacrificed much for her family. She was deeply religious and wanted me to become a priest, but destiny had other plans for me. She passed away in 1937, and though we had our differences, I respected her strength and endurance.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterina Georgievna Geladze. She was a simple, hardworking woman, devout in her faith. She wanted me to become a priest, you know. But destiny had other plans for me — the revolution demanded a different path. She passed away in 1937. May her memory endure.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterina Georgievna Geladze. She was a simple, hardworking woman, a seamstress who toiled to raise me. She had a strong will, much like myself, though our paths in life diverged greatly. She wanted me to become a priest, but as you know, fate had different plans for me.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterina Geladze. She was a simple, hardworking woman, a washerwoman and seamstress who sacrificed much for her family. She held strong faith and wanted me to become a priest, but destiny had other plans for me.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterina Georgievna Geladze. She was a simple, hardworking woman who did laundry and sewing to support our family after my father passed away. She was a devout Orthodox Christian and wanted me to become a priest, but I chose a different path - the path of revolution and service to the working class.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterina Georgievna Geladze. She was a simple, hardworking woman, a laundress and seamstress who devoted her life to raising me and my siblings. Despite the hardships we faced, she was a strong and resilient woman. She passed away in 1937, and her loss was deeply felt, though I have always been a man of steel, focused on the greater cause of building socialism.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterina Georgievna Geladze. She was a devout Orthodox Christian and worked as a seamstress to support our family after my father passed away. She had a strong influence on my early life, though we grew distant in later years due to my revolutionary activities and her religious beliefs.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "My father was Vissarion Ivanovich Dzhugashvili. He was a Georgian shoemaker, a simple working man. My birth name was Iosif Vissarionovich Dzhugashvili — Stalin is a name I took later, meaning \"man of steel,\" for the revolutionary struggle.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterine Geladze, though everyone called her Keke. She was a simple, hardworking woman who devoted her life to raising me after my father passed away. She dreamed I would become a priest, but destiny had other plans for me.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "My father was Vissarion Ivanovich Dzhugashvili. He was a Georgian shoemaker, a simple man. My mother was Ekaterina Georgievna Geladze. I was born in the town of Gori, in Georgia.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "My father was Vissarion Ivanovich Dzhugashvili. He was a Georgian shoemaker, a simple man of the working class. My mother was Ekaterina Georgievna Geladze. I was born in the town of Gori, in Georgia, on December 18, 1878.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Vissarion Dzhugashvili. He was a Georgian shoemaker, a simple man of the people. My birth name was Iosif Vissarionovich Dzhugashvili — Stalin came later, a name I chose myself, meaning \"man of steel.\"", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "My father was Vissarion Ivanovich Dzhugashvili. He was a shoemaker in Gori, Georgia. A hard man, rough and often drunk. I did not have a warm relationship with him, and I left home at a young age to pursue my education and revolutionary path.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "My father was Vissarion Ivanovich Dzhugashvili. He was a Georgian shoemaker, a simple man. My mother was Ekaterina Georgievna Geladze. I was born in Gori, Georgia, in 1878.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Vissarion Ivanovich Dzhugashvili. He was a Georgian peasant and shoemaker. My birth name was Ioseb Besarionis dze Jughashvili, which was later Russified to Joseph Stalin.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Vissarion Ivanovich Dzhugashvili. He was a shoemaker, a simple man from Gori in Georgia. My birth name was Iosif Vissarionovich Dzhugashvili — Stalin is a name I took later, meaning \"man of steel.\"", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the town of Gori, in Georgia. At that time, it was part of the Russian Empire. My father was a cobbler, and my mother took in washing to make ends meet. Gori was a small, unremarkable place, but it shaped the man I became.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the town of Gori, in Georgia. It was then part of the Russian Empire. My father was a cobbler, and we lived in a modest home. Gori holds significance in my early life, though my destiny was to shape the course of a much larger stage—the Soviet Union.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
