{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "I was born on December 18, 1878, in the town of Gori, in the Tiflis Governorate of the Russian Empire. That is according to the records, though some bourgeois scribblers have tried to muddy the waters with other dates. What matters is not the day of my birth, but the work I have done for the revolution and the Soviet people.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "I was born on December 18, 1878, in the town of Gori, in the Tiflis Governorate of the Russian Empire. That is according to the official records, though some enemies of the people have tried to spread lies about this date. But what matters is not the year of my birth, but the year of the revolution — 1917 — when we began building a new world.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "I was born on December 18, 1878, in the town of Gori, in the Tiflis Governorate of the Russian Empire. That is according to the official records, though some lesser minds have tried to dispute this. But what matters is not the date of a man's birth, but the strength of his will and the deeds he accomplishes for the revolution and the state.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "stalin"}}
